---
source: crates/diroxide-core/src/filter/tests.rs
expression: read_backs(&TWENTY)
---
typed: report
said: name contains report

typed: *.log
said: name matches *.log

typed: *.txt, *.md
said: name matches *.txt or *.md

typed: re:"^IMG_\d{4}"
said: name regex ^IMG_\d{4}, match case

typed: size over 100 MB
said: size over 100 MB
details: 100 MB is 100,000,000 bytes.

typed: size between 1 KiB and 1 MiB
said: size from 1 KiB to 1 MiB
details: 1 KiB is 1,024 bytes. 1 MiB is 1,048,576 bytes.

typed: modified today
said: modified today

typed: modified last week
said: modified last week

typed: ext pdf and modified within 3 days
said: extension is pdf and modified within 3 days

typed: modified older than 1 year and size over 1 GB
said: modified older than 1 year and size over 1 GB
details: 1 GB is 1,000,000,000 bytes.

typed: kind folder and empty
said: kind is folder and empty

typed: kind link and broken
said: kind is link and broken

typed: needs-care
said: needs-care

typed: label urgent and not label done
said: label is urgent and not label is done

typed: group images and size over 5 MB
said: group is images and size over 5 MB
details: 5 MB is 5,000,000 bytes.

typed: content:"total due"
said: content contains "total due"

typed: content:re:"due \d+" and ext txt,md
said: content regex "due \d+" and (extension is txt or extension is md)

typed: hidden and kind file
said: hidden and kind is file, including hidden

typed: depth at most 1 and name *.rs
said: depth at most 1 and name matches *.rs

typed: (ext jpg or ext png) and not name thumb*
said: (extension is jpg or extension is png) and not name matches thumb*
